  "plain": "People newly \"read in\" to a secret programme, meaning cleared and told about it, are said to have started digging through its backlog of old records, and that is when they got into trouble. Dylan Borland, a former Air Force intelligence specialist, passes this on as something he was told about people he does not name, sometime in the 2010s. If true, it would mean the programme's history was guarded even from its own cleared staff."
